Package: lacunarity
Type: Package
Title: What the Package Does (Title Case)
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Ikaro Barreto <daniel.carvalho.ib@gmail.com>
Maintainer: Ikaro Barreto <daniel.carvalho.ib@gmail.com>
Depends: R (>= 3.0.1)
Description: Lacunarity describes the similarity of parts from different regions of a series at a given scale. The lacunarity 
  index averages the behavior of variable size structures in a binary series. The generalized 
  lacunarity concept provides an enhanced measure of the organization of the gaps over all measured scales and over the
  different arrangements of smaller and larger gaps in time series.
